@bank all
// Pillar 5 Step 3 (head writer W2): texts said by nobody, for the test job and the first promotion (seat C2), team
// jobs (M2), tracing (M3), the T2 band, P1 and P2 (H2), the bridge lock and the turn-in meters (C2, U). Keys in
// content/works/keys-p5.md, "Step 3". Mails are "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds the sender).

// ---- the ladder rows
== works.mech.m8
- team jobs
== works.mech.m9
- tracing
== works.mech.p1
- when does it happen?
== works.mech.p2
- who saw what?

// ---- the test job and the first promotion (C2)
// Day 8: the Mail if you weren't at the board by 10:00 (Calder sends it)
== works.ask.t2
- Your test job | Tomorrow, your test job. A real Tier 2 job. I'll be watching. Sleep.
// delayed: another one in two work days
== works.ask.t2.again
- Another go | Another test job on {weekday}. Same rules. Get a few more filters under your belt first.
// Day 10, 10:30: the urgent toast
== promo.summons
- Chief Calder: My office, 11:00. — C.
// the Record's milestones and the keepsake
== works.ms.officer
- Promoted to Officer, day {n}.
== works.ms.commissioned
- Commissioned Officer, day {n}.
== works.keepsake.commission
- Your commission, framed. The Captain's signature is very neat.
// the door plate of 4-23
== works.plate
- {name} · {rank}
// the Captain's Mail on Day 10 (Mail, up to 400)
== mail.promo.captain
- Congratulations | Chief Calder tells me you've earned your pip. Well done. The ceremony is tomorrow at 17:15, in the observation room on Deck 1. Bring one honest answer: what should an officer never forget? I'll ask.
// Day 11, morning: from the Captain's office
== mail.promo.ceremony
- Your commission, 17:15 | The officer ceremony is today at 17:15, observation room, Deck 1. Clean uniform. It takes ten minutes. There will be tea.
// the move, if you were asleep or away (Calder's words by Mail)
== mail.promo.move
- Your cabin | You weren't about, so we moved you anyway. Cabin 4-23, officers' corridor. Your things are there. Your key opens it. Quiet hours after 23:00. Your door's your own now: use it. Tomas says don't be a stranger.
// the Ship app's news item
== news.promoted
- Works news: {me} made Officer today. Cake at the tea corner, while it lasts.

// ---- what's next: see next.lines

// ---- the bridge (C2; DA5's tap hook)
== bridge.locked
- The bridge. You'll need the Captain's invitation first.
- Bridge crew only. Someone will invite you, in time.
// the placeholder invitation, by Mail (with Vance's meeting bridgeInvite)
== mail.bridge.invite
- An invitation | The Captain invites you to the bridge. You're welcome up top from now on, and at bridge hour once a month. Clean boots. Nothing red is to be touched.

