// ---- team jobs (M2)
== works.ask.m8
- Recycler, 09:30 | Recycler's membrane bank, 09:30, Deck 3. Need four. You're the fourth. — E.H.
== team.name.recycler
- Recycler membrane change
== team.name.washer
- Washer overhaul
== team.name.manifold
- Manifold valve bank
== team.name.heater
- Heating pump swap
== team.name.scrubber
- Scrubber fan change
// the board card
== team.card
- {job}, {time}, Deck {deck}. A team of {n}.
// the 16:00 Mail the day before
== mail.team
- Team job, {time} | {job} tomorrow at {time}, Deck {deck}. You're on the team. Be at your spot when it starts.
// your turn (a toast)
== team.turn.brace
- Your turn: brace the housing
== team.turn.pass
- Your turn: pass the new part
== team.turn.hold
- Your turn: hold it steady
== team.turn.crank
- Your turn: crank the drum
== team.turn.tip
- Your turn: tip it and hold
== team.turn.valves
- Your turn: close the valves, in order
== team.turn.open
- Your turn: open the valves again
== team.turn.drain
- Your turn: drain it down
== team.start
- {job}: the team's here. Find your spot.
== team.wait
- {job}: they're waiting for you.
== team.late
- {job}: they started without you.
== team.done
- {job}: done. Good work, all of you.

// ---- tracing (M3)
== works.ask.m9
- The pipe kit | Board, first thing. Showers on Four are weak. You'll find out why.
== trace.title
- Pipe kit · {machine}
== trace.full
- full
== trace.low
- low
== trace.verylow
- very low
== trace.before
- Before: {word}
== trace.after
- After: {word}
== trace.found
- Full before, low after. It's {machine}.
== trace.symptom.water
- Showers weak on Deck {deck}
== trace.symptom.heat
- Cold cabins, {where}
== trace.symptom.air
- Stuffy air on Deck {deck}
== trace.line.water
- the water line
== trace.line.heat
- the heat line
== trace.line.air
- the air line
== chief.m9.1
- Read the middle first. Halve the line each time.
== chief.m9.2
- Fine before, low after: that's your machine. A walk is cheaper than a guess.

// ---- head-scratchers: T2, P1, P2 (H2)
== case.wrong.t2
- Not that. The {part} is spent, but now you know.
== chief.p1.1
- Bad all day: something's worn. Bad at the busy hours: something can't keep up.
== chief.p1.2
- Read the logs. A part that's fine in the morning can't be bad all day.
== case.title.p1
- {machine} {shows}, but only {when}.
== case.when.evening
- in the evening
== case.when.morning
- in the morning
== case.when.night
- at night
== case.when.peak
- at the busy hours
== case.when.after
- after it's been used
== case.strip.title
- How it ran, hour by hour
== case.strip.fine
- Fine {from}-{to}
== case.strip.low
- Low {from}-{to}
== chief.p2.1
- Ask who was there, and check they were.
== chief.p2.2
- Nobody lies. Somebody's mixed up. The Roster knows which.
== case.ask
- Ask about the fault
